 ## Retries
 
-A capture that times out is tried again, up to 3 attempts in all, one after the other.
+A capture that times out is tried again, up to 5 attempts in all, with a growing pause between them: 2, 4, 6 and 8
+seconds. Raised from 3 attempts with no pause after a busy Friday left 58 confirmed pantry orders uncharged, because
+the gateway's slow 17:00-19:00 peak swallowed all three back-to-back attempts in the same slow minute; replaying that
+Friday's timeouts against the sandbox showed 5 attempts spaced this way would have gone through for 57 of the 58. The
+member's confirmation page can now wait up to 20 seconds longer.
 
